+ Home --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|A terminal UI for a Bitcoin Cash P2Poolv2 node and the BCHN it mines on.                          |
|                                                                                                  |
|Node config              : D:/pool/node1/config.toml                                              |
|Network                  : chipnet                                                                |
|P2Pool API               : http://127.0.0.1:46884 (Bitcoin Cash chipnet)                          |
|BCHN                     : http://127.0.0.1:48332 (block 284,512, synced)                         |
|Dashboard                : http://127.0.0.1:46884/dashboard                                       |
|                                                                                                  |
|Up/Down picks a screen, Left/Right a tab, r refreshes, q quits.                                   |
|                                                                                                  |
